From c3c7c0b5ad616a959d5480a5aeddf4d18d15623f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:07:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add host review backend gated on ROBOREV_HOST_AGENT=1

The host agent hands a review to the model driving the current shell
through a file handoff. Handoff files are published atomically and the
answer is read only as a regular file, opened without blocking.

ROBOREV_HOST_AGENT=1 attaches a host. The rule lives in
HostMarker.Allows, and here every use needs the marker. Without it,
naming host is a hard error on every resolver. Automatic selection
never reaches host in this commit.

check-agents never smoke-tests host, and budget routing rejects it, so
this commit is safe on its own.
